WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:34.390 --> 01:37.100
Who... who are you?

01:37.100 --> 01:38.480
Not Pierre, that's for sure.

01:40.900 --> 01:42.450
My name is Glace.

01:42.860 --> 01:46.490
The King of the Magical World
is none other than me...

01:47.070 --> 01:48.700
its conqueror.

01:53.870 --> 01:57.460
Shining Heart!
The Next Queen is Chosen.

01:57.830 --> 01:58.230
Chocolat!

01:58.580 --> 01:59.470
You all right?

02:00.540 --> 02:02.430
Houx, Saule, you came to meet us?

02:02.790 --> 02:05.090
The Ogres are attacking Le Palais.

02:05.090 --> 02:07.300
We thought you might be
under attack as well,

02:07.300 --> 02:08.590
so we came to help you.

02:08.590 --> 02:09.810
La Palais...

02:09.810 --> 02:11.430
That's Glace!

02:11.430 --> 02:12.930
He was alive?

02:13.470 --> 02:14.850
Do not interfere.

02:14.850 --> 02:16.810
Noir Etoile!

02:17.390 --> 02:18.940
Stay back, you two!

02:18.940 --> 02:20.520
We'll take him on!

02:20.520 --> 02:21.810
Ruban d'lierre!

02:21.810 --> 02:23.090
Rapier d'lierre!

02:23.770 --> 02:25.530
And now, you will disappear.

02:25.530 --> 02:28.100
After bowing before
the might of my power!

02:29.860 --> 02:30.700
This guy's tough!

02:30.700 --> 02:32.110
There's no end to these spears!

02:34.280 --> 02:35.830
Those fools...

02:35.830 --> 02:38.700
How could they bring strife
to this sacred mountain?

02:39.210 --> 02:43.380
Indeed, it may have been a mistake
to reveal myself to you two.

02:46.000 --> 02:48.020
Fare thee well, Queen Candidates.

02:48.550 --> 02:50.760
Seek me not a second time.

02:52.590 --> 02:54.020
Wait, unicorn!

02:54.850 --> 02:56.300
What now?

03:04.690 --> 03:06.980
Now, Queen Candidates.

03:06.980 --> 03:09.210
You shall surrender your hearts to me.

03:09.610 --> 03:10.740
What?

03:11.740 --> 03:13.960
If you think you can take
them, go ahead and try!

03:14.240 --> 03:18.460
You really believe we'll hand over
our one and only hearts to you?

03:19.790 --> 03:22.660
Your hearts came out for
Pierre, did they not?

03:23.330 --> 03:25.710
Newsflash: You are NOT Pierre!

03:25.710 --> 03:26.880
Obviously.

03:27.960 --> 03:28.670
Why?

03:29.340 --> 03:31.800
Because the conqueror
of the Magical World,

03:31.800 --> 03:34.690
its ting, is me, Glace!

03:35.010 --> 03:38.220
Pierre is even more loyal to me...

03:38.220 --> 03:41.180
than those Chevaliers are to you.

03:41.640 --> 03:42.640
What?

03:42.640 --> 03:44.020
There's nothing to fear.

03:44.020 --> 03:47.650
Once you've offered your hearts
to me, you will not die.

03:48.230 --> 03:51.210
I will grant you new hearts.

03:51.570 --> 03:54.070
Noir hearts of hatred, that is.

03:54.660 --> 03:56.200
Sanction!

03:59.700 --> 04:01.160
Why are our hearts...?

04:03.210 --> 04:05.460
For someone of my magical ability,

04:05.460 --> 04:08.430
controlling your hearts is child's play.

04:08.800 --> 04:09.550
Stop it!

04:09.550 --> 04:10.340
Dammit!

04:13.170 --> 04:14.590
Houx! Saule!

04:18.510 --> 04:19.110
What?!

04:22.600 --> 04:25.390
It's the secret spell
she got from Amber!

04:25.390 --> 04:26.630
Plus, Chocolat is a...

04:27.060 --> 04:28.520
I am a Filtre.

04:28.520 --> 04:29.580
One who purifies!

04:30.730 --> 04:32.180
Ah yes, that's right.

04:32.180 --> 04:33.850
I'd forgotten that, Chocolat.

04:34.490 --> 04:35.370
Chocolat-chan!

04:36.110 --> 04:36.940
Vanilla!

04:40.280 --> 04:42.360
Do you think you can escape me?

04:42.830 --> 04:45.250
Chocolat-chan, he's catching up!

04:45.250 --> 04:47.600
But we can't fight on the
unicorn's mountain.

04:48.330 --> 04:50.710
Chocolat! Ride this!

04:50.710 --> 04:52.260
Vanilla-chama!

04:52.260 --> 04:53.090
Blanca!

04:53.090 --> 04:54.610
Thanks, Duke!

04:55.800 --> 04:57.090
Curse you...

04:58.590 --> 05:01.180
Obsucurite Cristalisation!

05:13.960 --> 05:15.440
That's...

05:17.280 --> 05:20.700
Didn't I tell you that
you cannot escape from me?

05:21.080 --> 05:25.250
The Ogre castle's saturated with Noir power. If we're sucked in, it's game over!

05:25.250 --> 05:26.540
Get away!

05:26.540 --> 05:27.620
Okay.

05:30.290 --> 05:33.450
All roads lead to my castle.

05:36.300 --> 05:38.130
We're getting closer and closer.

05:38.130 --> 05:39.680
What do we do, Chocolat-chan?

06:00.700 --> 06:02.130
The barrier is crumbling!

06:02.580 --> 06:03.910
We must counterattack!

06:03.910 --> 06:05.620
We will not.

06:05.620 --> 06:08.340
But if we don't, the Ogres
will enter the castle!

06:08.750 --> 06:12.040
Our true enemy lies within ourselves.

06:12.710 --> 06:16.100
It resides in the heart
that wishes to fight.

06:18.130 --> 06:19.680
It is as the Queen says.

06:19.680 --> 06:22.610
We will continue to follow her
until our power runs out.

06:24.350 --> 06:27.430
So the Senate Elders have
made their decision.

06:27.980 --> 06:30.190
What will you do, Robin?

06:30.190 --> 06:35.410
Is it our fate in life to accept
everything we are given?

06:37.280 --> 06:41.420
Even if we're given everything,
we can just find more to obtain.

06:43.200 --> 06:44.280
And we'll surely...

06:45.490 --> 06:46.700
find more.

06:48.910 --> 06:50.370
I can't fly right!

06:50.370 --> 06:51.470
We're falling!

06:56.300 --> 06:59.690
Your magic will become weaker
in close proximity to this castle.

07:00.010 --> 07:02.260
You can no longer escape.

07:02.260 --> 07:04.480
So hand over your hearts
like good little girls!

07:04.850 --> 07:06.190
Hey, where's Pierre?

07:06.560 --> 07:08.680
What did you do with him?

07:09.310 --> 07:11.020
Pierre has died.

07:11.690 --> 07:13.690
You two killed him.

07:15.150 --> 07:18.440
Pierre was unable to become
the Ogre Prince.

07:18.440 --> 07:20.950
He was far too feeble for that.

07:20.950 --> 07:24.160
He felt sympathy for you witches,

07:24.160 --> 07:25.720
and in doing so, chose death.

07:26.530 --> 07:29.450
So, are you witches satisfied now?

07:30.120 --> 07:33.540
But it's just like a witch,

07:33.540 --> 07:35.470
to bring ruin upon
those she once loved.

07:35.470 --> 07:36.670
You're wrong.

07:37.130 --> 07:39.880
You two killed Pierre,

07:39.880 --> 07:42.730
just like the Six Witches
once killed me.

07:42.730 --> 07:43.710
You're wrong!

07:44.590 --> 07:47.100
But I have revived.

07:47.100 --> 07:51.430
The power of Noir, born from the hatred
and envy of humans,

07:51.430 --> 07:53.480
has brought me back to life!

07:53.480 --> 07:56.190
But that body belongs to Pierre!

07:56.190 --> 07:57.400
So it does.

07:57.400 --> 08:01.390
When Pierre's soul expired,
this body was left behind...

08:01.390 --> 08:05.250
along with its Noir heart,
filled with hatred for the two of you.

08:05.740 --> 08:07.120
I can't...

08:07.120 --> 08:08.750
I can't believe that!

08:09.160 --> 08:12.200
Then how about this,
Chocolat Meilleure?

08:12.200 --> 08:14.290
You are a Filtre, a purifier.

08:14.830 --> 08:18.210
Would you like to try purifying
this Noir heart of mine?

08:19.170 --> 08:20.250
For a long...

08:20.250 --> 08:22.760
For far too long a time,

08:22.760 --> 08:26.640
this heart has hated Le Royaume.

08:26.640 --> 08:28.300
Can you purify it?

08:30.010 --> 08:32.310
There was once a foolish witch...

08:32.310 --> 08:34.100
who thought as you do.

08:34.810 --> 08:35.640
Yes,

08:35.640 --> 08:38.730
it was your mother,
Cinammon Meilleure.

08:38.730 --> 08:41.580
Show yourself, Cinnamon.

08:45.860 --> 08:47.240
Pierre's cat?

08:47.990 --> 08:49.120
Chocolat...

08:49.120 --> 08:51.590
Mama... is that your voice?

08:52.040 --> 08:53.830
Are you my mom?!

08:53.830 --> 08:58.290
I attempted to purify
the power of Glace's Noir.

08:59.080 --> 09:02.250
I was able to temporarily
weaken his power,

09:02.250 --> 09:04.120
but I could not purify him.

09:05.090 --> 09:07.970
As a result, I used up all of my power,

09:07.970 --> 09:11.470
and Glace's curse left me in this form.

09:13.020 --> 09:14.150
Mama...

09:14.770 --> 09:18.060
Glace, this appears to be your victory.

09:18.060 --> 09:22.140
Stop the Ogres' attack before
they devastate Le Royaume!

09:22.820 --> 09:24.900
This is the world you created.

09:25.570 --> 09:29.130
Will you destroy your world
with your own hands?

09:29.530 --> 09:32.490
You no longer have the power
you once possessed.

09:32.490 --> 09:34.580
Be silent and watch
from this vantage point.

09:36.290 --> 09:37.220
What?!

09:37.540 --> 09:39.470
Run away, Chocolat, Vanilla!

09:39.830 --> 09:40.830
Mama!

09:40.830 --> 09:43.420
Recall the trials of the unicorn.

09:43.960 --> 09:46.510
You must hold out hope
until the bitter end!

09:47.510 --> 09:48.690
Cease this!

09:52.550 --> 09:53.850
Mama!

09:53.850 --> 09:55.030
Make a break for it!

09:56.180 --> 09:57.740
This way, Vanilla-chama!

09:58.140 --> 09:59.950
Do what Cinammon says.

10:00.310 --> 10:01.230
Mama...

10:05.480 --> 10:08.150
This Ogre Castle is filled
with Noir energy.

10:08.150 --> 10:11.060
Go ahead and run yourselves
ragged inside it.

10:26.840 --> 10:27.670
Vanilla!

10:29.550 --> 10:31.190
I'm all worn out...

10:31.470 --> 10:33.390
What's wrong, Blanca?

10:33.390 --> 10:35.180
I can't take it, either...

10:35.180 --> 10:37.680
For some reason
I feel extremely tired.

10:38.140 --> 10:39.770
Every step I take...

10:39.770 --> 10:42.200
saps power from my body.

10:42.560 --> 10:45.570
I blame the Noir that's blanketing
every inch of this castle.

10:45.570 --> 10:49.460
It's enchanted to drain the power
of anyone who's not an Ogre.

10:49.740 --> 10:53.450
You're stronger than us
because you're a Filtre.

10:53.910 --> 10:55.490
Vanilla, hold onto me.

10:55.490 --> 10:56.530
Okay.

11:00.620 --> 11:02.790
This castle's like a maze,

11:02.790 --> 11:04.750
so where's the exit?

11:05.460 --> 11:07.250
The more we try to escape,

11:07.250 --> 11:09.310
the more power it drains from us.

11:20.980 --> 11:22.230
Chocolat,

11:22.230 --> 11:25.460
you are indeed
a worthy Queen Candidate.

11:26.020 --> 11:29.960
You've done well to withstand the Noir
power I've released in this castle.

11:30.360 --> 11:32.400
A Filtre you may be,

11:32.400 --> 11:34.910
but you won't be able to
stand for much longer.

11:37.160 --> 11:38.700
It's just like he says.

11:38.700 --> 11:40.540
We were so close, and yet so far.

11:40.540 --> 11:43.210
Mama... It seems like I'm doomed too.

11:43.920 --> 11:46.380
That heart of yours is undoubtedly...

11:46.380 --> 11:47.680
strong and beautiful.

11:48.500 --> 11:50.710
I'll allow it to enrich my power.

11:50.710 --> 11:53.490
Now, give your heart to me, Chocolat!

11:55.430 --> 11:56.890
Sanction!

11:56.890 --> 11:57.890
Wand!

12:02.850 --> 12:04.660
She's still resisting my power?

12:06.440 --> 12:09.070
No, I can't hold out any longer...

12:09.070 --> 12:11.360
Recall the unicorn's trials.

12:11.360 --> 12:13.990
You must hold out hope
until the bitter end!

12:13.990 --> 12:15.180
Mama...!

12:15.450 --> 12:17.660
Truth-Discerning Eyes...

12:17.660 --> 12:18.740
Oh yeah.

12:18.740 --> 12:21.830
I can sense it with my heart,
like Vanilla did.

12:30.210 --> 12:32.800
That's Pierre's heart.

12:32.800 --> 12:33.890
Pierre!

12:34.260 --> 12:36.840
Pierre, please wake up!

12:41.470 --> 12:42.390
Who?

12:42.390 --> 12:44.410
Who's calling my name?

12:44.770 --> 12:46.660
It's me, Chocolat!

12:46.940 --> 12:49.190
I don't know any Chocolat.

12:49.190 --> 12:50.980
Don't wake me up.

12:50.980 --> 12:52.940
I just want to sleep.

12:52.940 --> 12:54.670
Wait, Pierre!

12:55.030 --> 12:57.030
Don't wake me up.

12:57.030 --> 12:58.950
I just want to sleep.

12:58.950 --> 13:00.410
I just...

13:00.410 --> 13:02.290
Did you forget about me?

13:02.290 --> 13:03.410
I'm Chocolat.

13:03.410 --> 13:04.620
Never heard of you.

13:04.620 --> 13:06.580
I don't know anyone named Chocolat.

13:07.120 --> 13:08.170
Never heard of Chocolat...

13:08.670 --> 13:09.720
Pierre!

13:10.500 --> 13:12.000
The smell of chocolate...

13:12.670 --> 13:13.710
Are you...

13:14.460 --> 13:15.630
Chocolat?

13:16.260 --> 13:18.090
You've come to save me?

13:18.550 --> 13:21.710
But, no one can come to where I am.

13:21.970 --> 13:23.640
I can fly there...

13:23.640 --> 13:25.810
with these Wings of
Courage and Clarity!

13:28.440 --> 13:29.580
Pierre!

13:30.520 --> 13:31.940
Chocolat?

13:31.940 --> 13:33.730
You've come all the way here?

13:34.280 --> 13:35.320
You're...

13:35.860 --> 13:37.570
You really are...

13:38.740 --> 13:41.200
I wanted to see you, Pierre!

13:41.200 --> 13:43.780
I didn't want to believe you'd died!

13:44.410 --> 13:45.490
Chocolat...

13:45.950 --> 13:49.420
I... I love you, Pierre.

13:50.170 --> 13:51.880
You must hurry back, Chocolat.

13:51.880 --> 13:53.920
You shouldn't be here!

13:53.920 --> 13:55.760
Let's go back together, Pierre.

13:55.760 --> 13:58.380
This place is cold, almost as if...

13:59.130 --> 14:00.890
It's hopeless, Chocolat.

14:01.600 --> 14:03.030
I am already...

14:03.310 --> 14:04.470
Pierre!

14:05.600 --> 14:07.140
Farewell, Chocolat.

14:07.140 --> 14:09.310
No, Pierre, don't go!

14:09.310 --> 14:11.270
I'm so glad I met you.

14:11.270 --> 14:13.110
Pierre!

14:13.110 --> 14:13.980
No...

14:15.120 --> 14:16.610
Don't you die on me!

14:19.530 --> 14:20.950
You can have it!

14:22.740 --> 14:25.760
I'll give you my heart!

14:36.420 --> 14:37.550
Chocolat!

14:37.550 --> 14:38.800
Chocolat-chan!

14:41.010 --> 14:44.350
A witch's heart is far more
powerful than a human's.

14:44.350 --> 14:46.820
I have gained everything!

14:50.310 --> 14:51.350
Chocolat...

14:53.690 --> 14:54.660
My Chocolat...

14:55.610 --> 14:56.570
Pierre!

14:57.940 --> 14:58.780
Thank you,

14:59.240 --> 15:00.950
for giving me your heart.

15:00.950 --> 15:02.880
I'm so glad, Pierre.

15:09.750 --> 15:11.710
Chocolat-chan's pendant is...

15:11.710 --> 15:13.420
What the heck happened?

15:16.840 --> 15:18.000
This can not be...!

15:24.050 --> 15:26.930
Glace is separating from Pierre.

15:27.600 --> 15:29.680
The heart Glace took from Chocolat...

15:29.680 --> 15:32.060
is purifying Pierre's Noir.

15:32.060 --> 15:35.980
Glace can't control someone
unless they have Noir in them.

15:36.270 --> 15:39.440
Does that mean Pierre's heart
is inside Chocolat?

15:41.230 --> 15:44.780
Chocolat, now is the time
to purify everything.

15:44.780 --> 15:46.700
Can I really do that?

15:46.700 --> 15:49.010
I mean, even Mama couldn't...

15:49.580 --> 15:51.700
You may use my horn.

15:55.000 --> 15:55.970
The unicorn!

15:56.380 --> 15:58.090
Queen Candidates...

15:58.590 --> 16:01.300
the three trials I have given you...

16:01.300 --> 16:02.920
are now cleared.

16:06.970 --> 16:09.680
You, who possess
a Heart of Pure Love...

16:10.640 --> 16:12.890
My horn is my heart.

16:13.350 --> 16:17.240
Take it. Take my Crystal Heart.

16:19.520 --> 16:21.250
A heart of crystal?

16:21.780 --> 16:24.190
Chocolat. You have the power.

16:24.820 --> 16:26.750
I'll be at your side.

16:27.280 --> 16:30.010
Be brave, Chocolat.

16:30.680 --> 16:34.500
Pierre, when I'm with you,
I'm not afraid of anything.

16:35.290 --> 16:37.540
Even in that gloomy darkness,

16:37.540 --> 16:39.380
I wasn't afraid of anything.

17:21.090 --> 17:22.770
This light is...

17:30.050 --> 17:31.550
Thank you, Chocolat.

17:32.070 --> 17:36.390
You saved me from Glace's curse.

17:38.200 --> 17:39.690
So long.

17:39.690 --> 17:42.940
I wish I could've seen you as Queen.

17:44.030 --> 17:45.860
PIERRE!!

18:07.970 --> 18:09.340
Pierre...

18:16.890 --> 18:18.360
Unicorn...

18:19.730 --> 18:21.620
Never forget, Chocolat.

18:22.440 --> 18:26.580
You need take nothing, when
you already have everything.

18:39.210 --> 18:40.330
Chocolat...?

18:41.000 --> 18:42.080
Am I...

18:42.710 --> 18:44.540
Am I alive?

18:49.720 --> 18:52.140
Presenting the next Queen.

18:52.140 --> 18:54.760
The next Queen will be Vanilla Mieux!

19:03.940 --> 19:07.110
In the end, she had to use
up the unicorn horn,

19:07.110 --> 19:10.070
which she got in the final exam,
to purify Glace.

19:10.990 --> 19:14.160
So since Vanilla-chama was ahead
in the ecure standings...

19:14.620 --> 19:16.030
Congratulations, Vanilla.

19:16.700 --> 19:18.660
I mean, future Queen,

19:19.790 --> 19:21.660
Stand up, Chocolat-chan.

19:30.170 --> 19:32.690
I relinquish my succession as Queen.

19:33.430 --> 19:35.970
And bestow the crown
on Chocolat-chan.

19:35.970 --> 19:37.150
Vanilla?!

19:37.150 --> 19:38.890
IT CAN'T BE!!!

19:39.680 --> 19:42.640
Vanilla, you won't
regret this, will you?

19:42.640 --> 19:43.270
No.

19:43.730 --> 19:45.410
This is for the future
of the Magical World.

19:45.810 --> 19:48.980
I feel this is better for both...

19:48.980 --> 19:51.360
Le Royaume and the Ogres.

19:52.070 --> 19:53.360
Is that acceptable?

19:55.450 --> 19:57.070
As Her Majesty desires.

19:57.070 --> 19:59.580
However, Chocolat Meilleure...

19:59.580 --> 20:04.970
there is a mountain of subjects to study
in order to be a suitable Queen.

20:05.880 --> 20:07.960
No way, I hate that stuff!

20:07.960 --> 20:11.710
Hey, Queen Candy, can we go back
to the Human World for a while longer?

20:11.710 --> 20:14.940
There's so much more I want
to learn over there.

20:15.260 --> 20:18.680
After that, I'll take
my Queen studies seriously.

20:18.680 --> 20:19.800
Is that okay, old man?

20:20.510 --> 20:21.930
I understand.

20:22.390 --> 20:26.980
Return to the Human World,
along with Vanilla.

20:26.980 --> 20:28.650
This is great, Chocolat-chan!

20:28.650 --> 20:29.690
Yeah!

20:30.730 --> 20:35.860
Queen Candy saved many of those
Ogres from the purifying light.

20:36.320 --> 20:39.910
And the Ogre Prince still
being alive means...

20:39.910 --> 20:43.200
That's right.
His power has weakened,

20:43.200 --> 20:44.930
but Glace is still alive.

20:45.620 --> 20:49.790
And yet, the curse that Glace
put on you has been lifted.

20:49.790 --> 20:50.920
Why is that?

20:51.750 --> 20:53.420
I don't know.

20:53.420 --> 20:55.130
Chocolat's actions...

20:55.130 --> 20:58.640
may have changed
something within Glace.

20:59.680 --> 21:03.430
I must return to the land of the Ogres.

21:03.430 --> 21:06.850
I'll be leaving Chocolat
in your care again.

21:12.270 --> 21:16.490
And so, Chocolat Meilleure has been
selected as the next Queen.

21:19.450 --> 21:23.040
The Magical and Human Worlds
are at peace again, but...

21:23.040 --> 21:26.830
the Ogres and Le Royaume
are not completely unified.

21:28.500 --> 21:31.000
Even though Mama's returned
to her original witch form,

21:31.000 --> 21:33.090
I barely get to see her.

21:33.670 --> 21:37.510
I totally believe that we'll be able
to live together again someday.

21:40.850 --> 21:43.010
Sure, the Queen Exam is over,

21:43.010 --> 21:47.060
but Vanilla and I have tons of things
we want to do in the Human World,

21:47.060 --> 21:49.020
so we'll be here for awhile.

21:50.810 --> 21:53.400
Oh, and Pierre's fine too.

21:53.400 --> 21:55.230
Instead of Noir,

21:55.230 --> 21:58.070
it seems like he's getting pink
and orange hearts these days.

22:00.740 --> 22:03.450
I still can't believe this, but...

22:03.450 --> 22:06.290
Mama, I'm gonna be Queen.

22:06.950 --> 22:08.910
The first Royaume and Ogre Queen...

22:08.910 --> 22:11.540
that the Magical Worlds ever seen.

22:23.610 --> 22:26.110
That girl is good and this girl is good too

22:26.110 --> 22:27.760
It's so very hard to choose

22:28.780 --> 22:31.450
That guy is bad and this guy is bad

22:31.450 --> 22:33.000
Jealousy will drive them mad

22:36.710 --> 22:39.370
Dresses are nice, ribbons are nice too

22:39.370 --> 22:40.960
Blue jeans just won't do!

22:42.040 --> 22:44.670
How about a kiss, what about tomorrow?

22:44.670 --> 22:46.380
"I will not let you go home"

22:50.390 --> 22:52.550
Why is it that all boys

22:52.550 --> 22:54.550
are always the same

22:54.550 --> 22:58.350
and drive me up the wall?

22:58.350 --> 23:02.020
I don't get them at all

23:08.700 --> 23:11.360
Making big plans and going on dates

23:11.360 --> 23:13.040
from one town to the next

23:13.990 --> 23:16.750
Sitting on swingsets, staying up real late

23:16.750 --> 23:18.410
having our little chats

23:22.080 --> 23:24.710
Whispering voices, in between the bedsheets

23:24.710 --> 23:26.340
Little kisses are so sweet

23:27.390 --> 23:30.050
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:30.050 --> 23:31.510
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:32.680 --> 23:35.260
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:35.260 --> 23:37.060
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:38.060 --> 23:39.810
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:40.730 --> 23:42.400
Mama's gonna wake up soon
